<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>xform — Puppet Managed</title>
    <style>
        body { font-family: system-ui, sans-serif; max-width: 640px; margin: 4rem auto; padding: 0 1rem; color: #1a1a1a; }
        h1 { color: #b00; }
        code { background: #f4f4f4; padding: 2px 6px; border-radius: 3px; }
        .meta { color: #666; font-size: 0.9rem; }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <h1>Hello from Puppet!</h1>
    <p>This page is managed by <strong>Puppet</strong> on <code><%= @fqdn %></code>.</p>
    <p class="meta">
        OS: <%= @operatingsystem %> <%= @operatingsystemrelease %><br>
        Managed by: xform puppet-simple example
    </p>
</body>
</html>
